le text has been sanitized for Facebook/Instagram Ads compliance. No prohibited claims, no false guarantees and no direct personal attribute callouts.\",\n  \"language_rule\": \"All visible text inside the generated image must be written in [user's chosen language].\"\n}\n```\n","numLines":63,"startLine":405,"totalLines":467}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01CRY9NegBnpAYKCYiKnPDyN","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
